      ],
      "en": "Then the people of the land took Jehoahaz the son of Josiah, and made him king in his father’s place in Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "국민이 요시야의 아들 여호아하스를 세워 그 부친을 대신하여 예루살렘에서 왕을 삼으니",
      "source_text_hash": "7e02ee473f05b45f5cf9f433d0480d39e20a579cb8fdaf89a6cf1883d9438793",
      "translation_text_hash": "dc08987526dc0eaa7b5a5ad5aa29e0db0235b4ab3611cc0212a63d7fbf071d68",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
