        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Joahaz was twenty-three years old when he began to reign; and he reigned three months in Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "여호아하스가 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십 삼세더라 저가 예루살렘에서 치리한지 석달에",
      "source_text_hash": "a6f257ebf8262b261660bae100f401fb306a88facf8017763499e25376585d6c",
      "translation_text_hash": "95319e279331c09f97414ae75db5c0f4059c9e67469fa6bd0af081e1d047bcc6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호아하스가 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십 삼세더라 저가 예루살렘에서 치리한지 석달에"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "95319e279331c09f97414ae75db5c0f4059c9e67469fa6bd0af081e1d047bcc6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:36:3",
      "sequence": 11997,
