      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jehoiachin was eight years old when he began to reign, and he reigned three months and ten days in Jerusalem. He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight.",
      "ko": "여호야긴이 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 팔세라 예루살렘에서 석달 열흘을 치리하며 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f2b40b2332c18c8a04fd766d4f2f9696dc52c0224160b8b20081186864796f3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b28998bb04203f9032e007bdccf369ec234023eff435722815530e334f6337cc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호야긴이 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 팔세라 예루살렘에서 석달 열흘을 치리하며 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하였더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
