      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Zedekiah was twenty-one years old when he began to reign, and he reigned eleven years in Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "시드기야가 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십 일세라 예루살렘에서 십 일년을 치리하며",
      "source_text_hash": "752a92770dab046af80342b41818b192f0301b5b75fee12778cb4a8615295e6a",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb502dabaeaefc24ac91ed24fe2b3fbceaf59dcdf3e37cd76ed036988673ba2f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "시드기야가 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십 일세라 예루살렘에서 십 일년을 치리하며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cb502dabaeaefc24ac91ed24fe2b3fbceaf59dcdf3e37cd76ed036988673ba2f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:36:12",
      "sequence": 12006,
      "chapter_label": "2CH 36",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2CH",
