      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moreover all the chiefs of the priests and the people trespassed very greatly after all the abominations of the nations; and they polluted the LORD’s house which he had made holy in Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "제사장의 어른들과 백성도 크게 범죄하여 이방 모든 가증한 일을 본받아서 여호와께서 예루살렘에 거룩하게 두신 그 전을 더럽게 하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "0bfae02dcc7a34d36a15504279a2c689421fe5e8e9083e3f963a3498a2df783d",
      "translation_text_hash": "6f3088554cd9171152e210f484277dca74fa47794f563f3efb28328b80f6cb4a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
