      "en": "The LORD, the God of their fathers, sent to them by his messengers, rising up early and sending, because he had compassion on his people and on his dwelling place;",
      "ko": "그 열조의 하나님 여호와께서 그 백성과 그 거하시는 곳을 아끼사 부지런히 그 사자들을 그 백성에게 보내어 이르셨으나",
      "source_text_hash": "fec9facd3b7a1555d039311d6c363d9e3caaba9b7ad6d82c8bf201ad96c6db85",
      "translation_text_hash": "23b286e620651a5e98506962d6bfa51ef9f8dd7ba0cb2587a523655524cd2ba0",
