      "en": "but they mocked the messengers of God, despised his words, and scoffed at his prophets, until the LORD’s wrath arose against his people, until there was no remedy.",
      "ko": "그 백성이 하나님의 사자를 비웃고 말씀을 멸시하며 그 선지자를 욕하여 여호와의 진노로 그 백성에게 미쳐서 만회할 수 없게 하였으므로",
      "source_text_hash": "c16be69d36ace8e6eb8d18fd8deaa01a80a5af1648f0f970a626f0b0545060e9",
      "translation_text_hash": "441cc4ca6681c5dee3d4bda50c04417f995f2754982a8a63ee0cf12624df7a4d",
