      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "They burned God’s house, broke down the wall of Jerusalem, burned all its palaces with fire, and destroyed all of its valuable vessels.",
      "ko": "또 하나님의 전을 불사르며 예루살렘 성을 헐며 그 모든 궁실을 불사르며 그 모든 귀한 기명을 훼파하고",
      "source_text_hash": "a58eb2d889c0e39a147f0d345f83b60f55e43a1915df6eae337c029c88cd2e4e",
